      "writtenOn": "2016-02-16T16:21:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this just seems like a lot of work for almost no gain. This should be handled by wsgiref.util.application_uri and not by all applications.\n\nAlso, this should be pulled out into a function so that it\u0027s easier to test.",
      "revId": "1b29e3fb59ecf8574451e5a985cb687eb24faf5b",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
