        "patchSetId": 22
      },
      "lineNbr": 388,
      "author": {
        "id": 1916
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-02-16T19:36:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree but wsgiref is not handling it right now. All the specs (OAUTH, EC2, S3, etc) which include url in the signature required standard ports to be stripped out. Till wsgiref fixed it, we need to do the normalization ourselves.\n\nI\u0027ll pull this out into a separate utility function.",
      "parentUuid": "dae33548_e43c70e4",
      "revId": "1b29e3fb59ecf8574451e5a985cb687eb24faf5b",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
